            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6 italic">
          "The Tidy Gal did an amazing job cleaning my 4 bedroom, 3 bath house. Everything was spotless, and the
          attention to detail really stood out. I was especially impressed with how well they handled pet hair — my cat
          tree and furniture look better than they have in a long time. Professional, thorough, and clearly experienced.
          I’ll definitely be using The Tidy Gal again and would highly recommend them to anyone looking for a reliable
          cleaning service."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold"
          >
            RH
